== Result
On kindnet the policy applied to new connections only. The Collector pod started 03:55:19Z and opened
its gRPC connection to foc-jaeger:4317 before foc-airgap-egress was created (04:00:00Z); its log shows
no reconnect after 03:55:24Z. That connection kept delivering spans for at least 68.6 minutes after the
policy (step 1, 05:08:36Z; also every PILOT and record-run trace in between). After a restart, the
Collector's new connection timed out (steps 3, 4) and a new connection from its network namespace timed
out (5a), while the same requests from a namespace without a policy reached Jaeger (5b).
